ity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient secrets, follow the clues left by those who came before you, and uncover horrifying truths. Explore cursed corridors, solve puzzles, and do whatever it takes to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/7c255f9f90bfc92bb4bf0a9e8512b8ce.poster.avif?t=1776186040\" width=384 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/7c255f9f90bfc92bb4bf0a9e8512b8ce.webm?t=1776186040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/7c255f9f90bfc92bb4bf0a9e8512b8ce.mp4?t=1776186040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/0396a154221b5c47284e155fbc551f92.poster.avif?t=1776186040\" width=384 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/0396a154221b5c47284e155fbc551f92.webm?t=1776186040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/0396a154221b5c47284e155fbc551f92.mp4?t=1776186040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/7e50fff7066f024f62405bafce689dc0.poster.avif?t=1776186040\" width=384 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877870/extras/7e50fff7066f024f62405bafce689dc0.webm?t=1776186040\" type=\"video